{"id":"00426","root":"uni00426_1","name":{"ja":"ふうま　廻","en":"Fuuma Mawari"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ふうま　廻","en":"Fuuma Mawari"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":257,"profile":{"ja":"ふうまの遠い血縁にあたる同級生対魔忍。校内ではしょっちゅう転ぶ天然ドジっ子体質で有名。『百光』という、発動時に視界内にいる者を全てスロー状態にする邪眼能力を持つ。強力だが効果時間は数秒で、発動中は動く事ができないため、戦いにおいては仲間とのチームワークが欠かせない。また、能力の代償として時間や空間の概念が一時的に狂い、効果が切れても完全には抜けないという特性があり、廻の天然ドジ体質はそれによるもの。だが、体質に甘えず努力する姿や、人のために行動する姿を五車の誰もが知っているため、転ぶ彼女をからかう者はいない。","en":"She is a distant relative of the Fuuma clan and a fellow Taimanin student. She is known for her clumsy nature, often tripping and falling within the school grounds. She possesses the \"Hakko\" evil eye ability, which slows down everyone within her line of sight. Although it's a powerful ability, it only lasts for a few seconds, and she is unable to move while it's active, making teamwork with her allies crucial in battle. The ability also temporarily disrupts her sense of time and space, causing her natural clumsiness. However, she doesn't use her condition as an excuse and always strives to improve, which is why no one teases her about her clumsiness."},"illustrator":"相川亜利砂","voiceActor":"愛部えみり","forms":[{"id":"uni00426_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[788,1576],"sp":[130,130],"atk":[126,252],"def":[96,192],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","960009"]},{"id":"uni00426_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1176,2352],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[202,404],"def":[142,284],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","960009","960010"]},{"id":"uni00426_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1564,3122],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[278,557],"def":[188,376],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","960009","960010"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"